msgctxt "64"
msgid "*pant* *pant* I'm sorry... I just... couldn't help myself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"I don't know if there is such a thing. Now answer my question! What's the "
"deal with this Golden Agu pork I keep hearing about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Do I need to spell it out for you? \"Golden Agu\" is a sham, my friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"We buy the pork cheap from China and Australia. Then we\r\n"
"roast it up or glaze it, and no one knows the difference."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Selling this shit on the internet with a flashy brand name\r\n"
"rakes in ten times the profit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "So that's what this is about..."
msgstr "Oh, ecco di cosa si tratta..."

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Yeah. And now that you know, how about layin' off, huh?\r\n"
"After all, suckers deserve what they get."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"What a filthy, filthy man you are! You ought to be ashamed\r\n"
"of yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Local Okinawans are working themselves to the bone to raise\r\n"
"up authentic agu pork, and I won't let cowards like you\r\n"
"sully their reputation!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah? And who the hell are you old hacks supposed to be? The local "
"chapter of the pork patrol? Hah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "I suggest you show some respect and apologize."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Maybe when pigs fly...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"When it comes to the locals who worked hard to raise their\r\n"
"food, you'd better watch out. Compared to what they're\r\n"
"capable of, what I did to you was nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr "Urgh..."

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Out with it! We want a public apology! And that's just the\r\n"
"beginning!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Forgive me... I've been nothing but a selfish, greedy hog..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"Thanks to you, we finally figured out the secret behind this porcine "
"phenomenon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Indeed, we appreciate your help. But aren't you a tad\r\n"
"disappointed I won't be getting any prettier by eating\r\n"
"high-quality pork, Kiryu-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Heh... I guess I am."
msgstr "Ehe. Immagino di sì."

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"The other butchers and I would like you to have this as a\r\n"
"token of our gratitude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "352"
msgid "We'll be reporting this swindler to the police now. Thanks again."
msgstr ""

